title: a reading log of placed nodes
pid: 20fdfe61-690b-4ec1-84f8-161b670e5abf
body: |2-
  Tried: placing four of the notes I had read under a node of my own, as a log of what I had read.
  Expected: a list I could check new changes against.
  Happened: a placed node brings its whole subtree with it, so one of the four, "management team", added about fifty lines to my home note. The log does not know which version I read: if Jeff edits one of these tomorrow, nothing in it will change. And the only trace Jeff could see is one more container on each note, which says "contained", not "read".
  Claude deleted the log after the mission, for those reasons.
